- Update to version 1.2.0:
  * Complete Rust egui/eframe Studio GUI for MSI Mystic Light
  * Full 24-zone and 4-zone per-key LED theme engine
  * 16 curated dynamic presets: Aurora, Cyberpunk, Retrowave,
    Vaporwave, Rainbow Wave, Ocean Breeze, Firestorm, and more
  * Real-time custom color stop gradient engine
  * Hardware diagnostics and USB hidraw sensor probe
  * Udev hardware rules for unprivileged user access
  * Systemd user units for auto-apply on login and resume

